# Scripts — Trader Demand Ranking

Ranked by market demand, search volume, and what traders actively pay for.

| Rank | Script | Why Traders Buy It | Price Range |
|------|--------|-------------------|------------|
| 1 | **Close All Trades** | Instantly closes every open position — #1 downloaded script on MQL5 | $5–$20 |
| 2 | **Delete All Pending Orders** | Removes all pending orders in one click — essential risk management | $5–$15 |
| 3 | **Risk Calculator (Lot Sizer)** | Calculates lot size from SL distance and risk % — prevents over-leveraging | $10–$30 |
| 4 | **Export Trade History to CSV** | Exports closed trades for analysis/tax — compliance + analytics | $10–$25 |
| 5 | **Set Breakeven for All** | Moves all SL to entry price — instant risk-free positions | $5–$15 |
| 6 | **Close Profitable Only** | Closes winning trades, keeps losers running — profit-taking utility | $5–$15 |
| 7 | **Close Losing Only** | Cuts all losses at once — damage control | $5–$15 |
| 8 | **Auto SL/TP Setter** | Automatically sets SL/TP on every new position — safety net | $10–$25 |
| 9 | **Screenshot + Export Chart** | Saves chart snapshot with timestamp — journaling & sharing | $5–$15 |
| 10 | **Quick Order Panel** | One-click buy/sell with preset lot size — speed for scalpers | $10–$30 |

---

## Buying Signals

- **Tier 1 (Rank 1–3):** Close All, Delete Pendings, Lot Sizer — traders need these daily. High volume, low price, but massive download counts.
- **Tier 2 (Rank 4–6):** Export History, Breakeven, Close Profitable — mid-tier utilities for active traders.
- **Tier 3 (Rank 7–10):** Close Losers, Auto SL/TP, Screenshot, Quick Panel — niche but consistent demand.
